---
// SaarVsGaarDiagram.astro
---
<div class="my-10 bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-navy-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto shadow-sm">
  <div class="text-center mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Anti-Avoidance Framework</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400">Targeted snipers vs. The nuclear option</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-stretch justify-center">
    
    <!-- SAAR -->
    <div class="flex-1 bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gold-500"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gold-50 dark:bg-gold-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-gold-600 dark:text-gold-500">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 15l-2 5L9 9l11 4-5 2zm0 0l5 5M7.188 2.239l.777 2.897M5.136 7.965l-2.898-.777M13.95 4.05l-2.122 2.122m-5.657 5.656l-2.12 2.122"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white text-lg">SAAR</h4>
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-500 font-bold">Specific Anti-Avoidance</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 mb-6 flex-grow">
        Surgical rules designed to kill one specific transaction pattern. If your transaction falls outside the strict definition, you survive.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded-lg p-3 border border-navy-100 dark:border-navy-800">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-navy-500 mb-2 uppercase">Examples</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300 font-mono">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gold-500">→</span> Sec 94(7): Dividend Stripping</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gold-500">→</span> Sec 94(8): Bonus Stripping</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gold-500">→</span> Sec 50CA: Real Estate Undervaluation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VS Divider -->
    <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col justify-center items-center px-2">
      <div class="w-px h-16 bg-navy-200 dark:bg-navy-700"></div>
      <div class="my-3 text-xs font-bold text-navy-400 uppercase bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 px-2 py-1 rounded">VS</div>
      <div class="w-px h-16 bg-navy-200 dark:bg-navy-700"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- GAAR -->
    <div class="flex-1 bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 border border-red-500/30 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-red-500"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 dark:text-red-500">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white text-lg">GAAR</h4>
          <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-500 font-bold">General Anti-Avoidance</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 dark:text-navy-400 mb-6 flex-grow">
        The overarching doctrine. If a transaction lacks commercial substance and exists purely to avoid tax, the department can override the entire structure.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-navy-50 dark:bg-navy-900 rounded-lg p-3 border border-navy-100 dark:border-navy-800">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-navy-500 mb-2 uppercase">Trigger Conditions</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 mt-0.5">⊗</span> Main purpose is tax benefit</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 mt-0.5">⊗</span> Lacks commercial substance</li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-red-500 mt-0.5">⊗</span> Not bona fide business purpose</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
